 words it means sky blue colored water body. And interestingly the color of the water was really bluish. The clouds from the sky easily reflect on the pristine water from the Haor.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\nFew places are occupied with water there. So local people usually do fishing, and probably they will continue until the area dried up totally. Most of the fishing nets are having same design and structure. Also, the style of fishing is a bit different from other area as well.</p>\r\n\r\n<h1>Master Plan of Haor Area</h1>\r\n\r\n<p>The&nbsp;Bangladesh Haor&nbsp;and Wetland Development Board (BHWDB) has taken the initiative to prepare a comprehensive Master Plan with a view to preserve, protect.&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '[{\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/images\\/1c11f6036cbd4d4f03376e4389dbc38a.jpeg\"},{\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/images\\/7c0b55a3be1f29744b84353d7cbe61f4.jpeg\"}]', '2023-11-05 13:07:35', '2023-11-11 16:34:08'),
(107, 1, 9, 'Dekar Haor', '7,282 Hec', 'uploads/images/dc865e7c339a2e78f8cf364156dab1d9.jpeg', 'uploads/images/ba607b306ccbb96e95bd5592a78ec40e.jpeg', 'uploads/images/53ef7df4ba28f29fa0361b7a8d9c45c7.jpeg', 'Dekar Haor are special type of Inland Wetlands of Bangladesh situated in the north-eastern zone of the country.', '<p>ABOUT<br />\r\nDekar Haor is a small one, but extraordinarily beautiful. The word Akashi means sky blue color and the word Haor means inundated water body that is created due to overflowing of nearby river.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n&bull; &nbsp; &nbsp;Official Name:&nbsp;Dekar Haor<br />\r\n&bull; &nbsp; &nbsp;District:&nbsp;Sunamganj<br />\r\n&bull; &nbsp; &nbsp;Upazila: Sunamganj Sadar<br />\r\n&bull; &nbsp; &nbsp;Area. 7,282 Hectares.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>LOCATION</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><em>Dakshin</em>&nbsp;Sunamganj Upazila LAT: 24.97230000, LON: 91.39280000. REGION</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>AREA</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><em>Economics of Small Scale Capture Fishing</em>&nbsp;in Dekhar Haor of Sunamganj District, Bangladesh.</p>\r\n', '<h1><strong>Geographic Information</strong></h1>\r\n\r\n<p>&#39;<em>Dekhar Haor</em>&#39; is one of the biggest haors of Sunamganj with four upazilas of Sunamganj Sadar, Dakshin Sunamganj, Doarabazar and Chatak. The viewing hour is called Boro Bhandar. In the coming rainy season, sometimes there will be turbulent water play, sometimes it will flow calmly. Haor&#39;s chest was decorated with a vast sky. Sunamganj city&#39;s entry point Ahsan Mara area will welcome the &#39;Muktijudda Bhaskrya&#39; part of the visit Haor tour.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://amarhaor.com/uploads/images/Dekar Haor 4_1699181518.jpg\" style=\"height:351px; width:624px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>The photo was taken recently. Photo: Anees Mahmood</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://amarhaor.com/uploads/images/Dekar Haor 5_1699182137.jpg\" style=\"height:239px; width:425px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>A fishing boat is entering Howar through the canal. And the vehicle is going downhill. The photo is from South Sunamganj area.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Photo: Anees Mahmood</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://amarhaor.com/uploads/images/Dekar Haor 6_1699182185.jpg\" style=\"height:239px; width:425px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>The fishing boat is drifting. The photo is from South Sunamganj area.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Photo: Anees Mahmood</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://amarhaor.com/uploads/images/Dekar Haor 7_1699182229.jpg\" style=\"height:239px; width:425px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Two fishermen are going to catch fish with a net.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Photo: Anees Mahmood</p>\r\n\r\n<h1><strong>Conservation efforts</strong></h1>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>SYLHET, Dec 28: Many croplands in Sunamganj district have become dry and is not ready for Boro paddy farming. A vast area on the Dekhar Haor has been dried up as influential fishermen groups withdrew water from the large waterbody for fishing weeks ago.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Farmers in good numbers in Sunamganj Sadar upazila alleged that the lessees of various haors withdrew water from the Dekhar Haor and others indiscriminately in November.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A farmer of the Lalpur area claimed that he had prepared land for cultivating Boro on 10 Bighas, but it is not possible due to water shortage.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The vast Dekhar Haor spreads Sunamganj Sadar, Biswambharpur, Doarabazar and Chhatak. Out of the total 10,000 hectares in Dekhar haor, about 9000 hectares are used for Boro paddy cultivation every year.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This year, 222,300 hectares in the district would be used for Boro farming.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '[{\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/images\\/dc865e7c339a2e78f8cf364156dab1d9.jpeg\"},{\"image\":\"\"},{\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/images\\/b2fd7477d343687f06850bf1c60b7b3a.jpeg\"},{\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/images\\/4e1f4e6b30b6c4f61f856dbc7490d7ba.jpeg\"}]', '2023-11-05 13:08:33', '2023-11-11 16:32:41'),
(108, 1, 9, 'Dhakua Haor', '3,032 Hec', 'uploads/images/1b9515c53045234eea78d668c114016d.jpeg', 'uploads/images/ae94d9a09d604afa690c19b3057c0372.jpeg', 'uploads/images/5a8bf50200e7f7d099ae1725f298f776.jpeg', 'Dhakua Haor are special type of Inland Wetlands of Bangladesh situated in the north-eastern zone of the country.', '<p><strong>ABOUT</strong><br />\r\nDhakua Haor is a small one, but extraordinarily beautiful. The word Akashi means sky blue color and the word Haor means inundated water body that is created due to overflowing of nearby river.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n&bull; &nbsp; &nbsp;Official Name:&nbsp;Dhakua Haor<br />\r\n&bull; &nbsp; &nbsp;District:&nbsp;Sunamganj<br />\r\n&bull; &nbsp; &nbsp;Upazila: Sunamganj Sadar<br />\r\n&bull; &nbsp; &nbsp;Area. 3,032 Hectares.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>LOCATION</strong><br />\r\nSylhet</p>\r\n', '<h1>Geographic Information</h1>\r\n\r\n<p>In a country where one third of all area can be termed as wetlands, the haor basin is an internationally important wetland ecosystem, spread over Sunamganj, Habiganj, Moulvibazar districts and Sylhet Sadar Upazila, as well as Kishoreganj and Netrokona districts outside the core haor area.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A haor is a wetland ecosystem in the north eastern part of Bangladesh which physically is a bowl or saucer shaped shallow depression, also known as a backswamp. During monsoon haors receive surface runoff water from rivers and canals to become vast stretches of turbulent water.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The total area of haor-type wetland ecosystem in Bangladesh is&nbsp;80,000 square kilometres. The haor basin is bounded by the hill ranges of India &ndash; Meghalaya on the north, Tripura and Mizoram on the south, and Assam and Manipur on the east.</p>\r\n\r\n<h1>Conservation efforts</h1>\r\n\r\n<p>Dhakua Haor is a small one, but extraordinarily beautiful. The word Akashi means sky blue color and the word Haor means inundated water body that is created due to overflowing of nearby river. So, combining the two words it means sky blue colored water body. And interestingly the color of the water was really bluish. The clouds from the sky easily reflect on the pristine water from the Haor.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\nFew places are occupied with water there. So local people usually do fishing, and probably they will continue until the area dried up totally. Most of the fishing nets are having same design and structure. Also, the style of fishing is a bit different from other area as well.</p>\r\n\r\n<h1>Master Plan of Haor Area</h1>\r\n\r\n<p>The&nbsp;Bangladesh Haor&nbsp;and Wetland Development Board (BHWDB) has taken the initiative to prepare a comprehensive Master Plan with a view to preserve, protect.&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '[{\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/images\\/5a8bf50200e7f7d099ae1725f298f776.jpeg\"},{\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/images\\/1b9515c53045234eea78d668c114016d.jpeg\"},{\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/images\\/ae94d9a09d604afa690c19b3057c0372.jpeg\"}]', '2023-11-05 13:09:12', '2023-11-11 16:32:05'),
(109, 1, 9, 'Dhamai Haor', '932 Hec', 'uploads/images/3ebf29171652ec78e8cb9b405d68c75a.jpeg', 'uploads/images/f80d7773c28f192d1bc01a0643e5a526.jpeg', 'uploads/images/66ba0a59e78e44dc6f0a8f27cab631a7.jpeg', 'Dhamai Haor  are special type of Inland Wetlands of Bangladesh situated in the north-eastern zone of the country.', '<p><strong>ABOUT</strong><br />\r\nDhamai Haor is a small one, but extraordinarily beautiful. The word Akashi means sky blue color and the word Haor means inundated water body that is created due to overflowing of nearby river.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n&bull; &nbsp; &nbsp;Official Name:&nbsp;Dhamai Haor<br />\r\n&bull; &nbsp; &nbsp;District:&nbsp;Sunamganj<br />\r\n&bull; &nbsp; &nbsp;Upazila: Sunamganj Sadar<br />\r\n&bull; &nbsp; &nbsp;Area. 932 Hectares.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>LOCATION</strong><br />\r\nSylhet</p>\r\n', '<h1>Geographic Information</h1>\r\n\r\n<p>In a country where one third of all area can be termed as wetlands, the haor basin is an internationally important wetland ecosystem, spread over Sunamganj, Habiganj, Moulvibazar districts and Sylhet Sadar Upazila, as well as Kishoreganj and Netrokona districts outside the core haor area.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A haor is a wetland ecosystem in the north eastern part of Bangladesh which physically is a bowl or saucer shaped shallow depression, also known as a backswamp. During monsoon haors receive surface runoff water from rivers and canals to become vast stretches of turbulent water.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The total area of haor-type wetland ecosystem in Bangladesh is&nbsp;80,000 square kilometres. The haor basin is bounded by the hill ranges of India &ndash; Meghalaya on the north, Tripura and Mizoram on the south, and Assam and Manipur on the east.</p>\r\n\r\n<h1>Conservation efforts</h1>\r\n\r\n<p>Dhamai Haor is a small one, but extraordinarily beautiful. The word Akashi means sky blue color and the word Haor means inundated water body that is created due to overflowing of nearby river. So, combining the two words it means sky blue colored water body. And interestingly the color of the water was really bluish. The clouds from the sky easily reflect on the pristine water from the Haor.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\nFew places are occupied with water there. So local people usually do fishing, and probably they will continue until the area dried up totally. Most of the fishing nets are having same design and structure. Also, the style of fishing is a bit different from other area as well.</p>\r\n\r\n<h1>Master Plan of Haor Area</h1>\r\n\r\n<p>The&nbsp;Bangladesh Haor&nbsp;and Wetland Development Board (BHWDB) has taken the initiative to prepare a comprehensive Master Plan with a view to preserve, protect.&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '[{\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/images\\/3ebf29171652ec78e8cb9b405d68c75a.jpeg\"},{\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/images\\/66ba0a59e78e44dc6f0a8f27cab631a7.jpeg\"},{\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/images\\/f80d7773c28f192d1bc01a0643e5a526.jpeg\"},{\"image\":\"\"}]', '2023-11-05 13:09:56', '2023-11-11 16:31:42');
