 for its scenic beauty. You can enjoy the gentle breeze that hits on the face after kissing the surface of the water. If you are a traveler, then you will always find out every bit of our traveling, interesting.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Eating Facilities</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>As well as you can find many more restaurant here for food.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Travel Tips</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Do not try to stay in the Haor at evening for it would be safe for you.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '[{\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/images\\/63eb4f1a4a98394d606a750a3678d86a.jpeg\"},{\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/images\\/b33cc6498917c7fd4dca39f63387eca7.jpeg\"}]', '2023-11-05 19:40:21', '2023-11-11 19:03:00'),
