(1, 1, 'Chhatak', '19,460 Hec', '11', 'uploads/images/5080a2eb682bc3c3f88c6c91c5e1dcaf.png', '<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Haors are special type of Inland Wetlands of Bangladesh situated in thenorth-eastern zone of the country. They are fresh water (seasonal) inland lakes. Considering the importance of Haorin the national economy as well as of its hydrological characteristics and very rich biodiversity, it wasfelt necessary to prepare a separate volume of the report, exclusively dealing with Haors.</p>\r\n', '2023-10-31 03:59:33', '2023-11-02 17:22:54'),
